1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,480
It's been five days since I debuted
as a professional hero.

2
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:08,640
There haven't been
any serious incidents so far.

3
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:13,320
However, for some reason Genos
is staying at my house.

4
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:16,450
What are you writing over there?

5
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:19,750
I'm recording the details of
your lessons and training regimen.

6
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:22,730
Crap. He's raising the bar again...

7
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:26,170
I can't think of a single thing
I can teach the guy.

8
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:28,910
I feel bad, like I'm scamming him
or something.

9
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:33,510
Come on, think. Or just make up
some techniques or a spiritual theory.

10
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:35,640
Bah, strength training is all I've got!

11
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:38,310
I know Genos won't be satisfied
with that, plus the dude's a cyborg!

12
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:39,170
By the way,

13
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:42,310
at the seminar
they said if you're a Class C hero

14
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:44,480
and you have no hero activity
for a week,

15
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:47,280
your name will be removed
from the Hero Registry.

16
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,780
Will you be all right, Master?

17
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:50,990
They said that?!

18
00:00:50,990 --> 00:00:51,860
Yes.

19
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:55,120
But I was watching TV and
there wasn't anything going on.

20
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:58,200
The news only reports
major incidents,

21
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,920
like natural disasters, terrorism
and dangerous monsters.

22
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:04,540
You always fight
the most powerful enemies,

23
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:06,090
so you probably do not know it,

24
00:01:06,090 --> 00:01:09,340
but Class C heroes primarily
take care of purse snatchers,

25
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:11,410
robberies and random attacks.

26
00:01:11,410 --> 00:01:13,340
With Class C so full of heroes,

27
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:16,050
to survive they must actively
look for cases to resolve.

28
00:01:16,050 --> 00:01:18,600
I hear many of them get discouraged
and change careers.

29
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:20,600
Like a salesman doing cold calls,

30
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:23,850
nothing will come your way
without legwork.

31
00:01:23,850 --> 00:01:26,110
This is no time to be reading manga!

32
00:01:26,170 --> 00:01:27,360
So we're going?

33
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:28,400
You stay here!

34
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,860
If I'm with a Class S hero,

35
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:32,450
a Class C like me
won't get any credit!

36
00:01:32,450 --> 00:01:34,570
But as your disciple—

37
00:01:35,390 --> 00:01:39,660
Genos, from the beginning
my intense desire to be a hero

38
00:01:39,660 --> 00:01:42,080
was what drove me
to strength training.

39
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:43,660
That's how I made it this far.

40
00:01:43,980 --> 00:01:50,010
For you, perhaps things will change
if you aim higher as a hero.

41
00:01:50,010 --> 00:01:54,630
Frankly speaking, you're a cyborg,
so training your body won't do.

42
00:01:54,630 --> 00:01:57,930
Instead, a change in mindset
may lead you to greater strength.

43
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:03,140
Damn, I'm just making
all this crap up...

44
00:02:04,060 --> 00:02:06,520
So...in other words,

45
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:12,780
HOW I DEVELOPED
INDOMITABLE WILL

46
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:12,780
BY S CLASS
HERO KING

47
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:09,690
it's not about having
raw power or technique;

48
00:02:09,690 --> 00:02:11,980
it's about training your mind.

49
00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:12,780
To do that,

50
00:02:12,780 --> 00:02:15,490
you must first fight your way through
the professional hero industry.

51
00:02:15,490 --> 00:02:19,160
Aim to break into the top ten
of the Class S heroes.

52
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:21,870
That will be your goal for now.

53
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:26,460
I understand. I will try!

54
00:02:26,460 --> 00:02:29,380
He bought it... Sweet.

55
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:37,680
After that, I sped around town.

56
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,850
While frantically looking
for bad guys...

57
00:02:40,380 --> 00:02:41,350
I ran.

58
00:02:41,350 --> 00:02:42,680
and ran..

59
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:44,580
and ran...

60
00:02:44,580 --> 00:02:46,120
But!

61
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:48,560
The city was quiet!

62
00:02:49,340 --> 00:02:51,520
I give up...

63
00:02:52,590 --> 00:02:54,980
Just one more day left.

64
00:02:58,040 --> 00:03:00,450
Guess I'll head home.

65
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:07,000
I'll leave tomorrow's problems
to tomorrow's me.

66
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:21,640
One punch

67
00:03:25,350 --> 00:03:27,100
Three, two, one, kill shot

68
00:03:27,100 --> 00:03:30,860
sanjou, hisshou, shijou saikyou

69
00:03:27,100 --> 00:03:30,860
He joins the fight, he wins, the strongest in history

70
00:03:30,860 --> 00:03:32,860
nan datten da, frustration

71
00:03:30,860 --> 00:03:32,860
Are you talking to him? Frustration ☹

72
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:34,360
ore wa tomaranai

73
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:34,360
He's not going to stop

74
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:38,490
one punch, kanryou, rensenrenshou

75
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:38,490
One punch, that's it, one fight after another

76
00:03:38,490 --> 00:03:42,120
ore wa katsu, tsune ni katsu, asshou

77
00:03:38,490 --> 00:03:42,120
He wins, he always wins, overwhelmingly

78
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:45,950
power, get power

79
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:45,950
Power, get power

80
00:03:45,950 --> 00:03:48,920
girigiri genkai made

81
00:03:45,950 --> 00:03:48,920
On to the very edge

82
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:50,130
Hero

83
00:03:50,130 --> 00:03:53,290
ore o tataeru koe ya

84
00:03:50,130 --> 00:03:53,290
There are voices praising him

85
00:03:53,290 --> 00:03:56,340
kassai nante hoshiku wa nai sa

86
00:03:53,290 --> 00:03:56,340
but he's not doing this for acclaim

87
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:57,590
Hero

88
00:03:57,590 --> 00:04:02,350
dakara hitoshirezu aku to tatakau

89
00:03:57,590 --> 00:04:02,350
So he just fight evil without end

90
00:04:02,350 --> 00:04:03,810
Nobody knows who he is

91
00:04:03,810 --> 00:04:07,980
sora ooi oshiyoseru teki

92
00:04:03,810 --> 00:04:07,980
Enemies to fight are numerous as the stars

93
00:04:07,980 --> 00:04:08,020
{OP Sync Point - Smiley Star, First Frame}

94
00:04:07,980 --> 00:04:11,060
ore wa se wo muke wa shinai

95
00:04:07,980 --> 00:04:11,060
and he's not gonna turn his back on you

96
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:12,400
Hero

97
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:17,400
naraba yuruginaki kakugo shita tame

98
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:17,400
He's made up his mind and ain't gonna yield

99
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:24,620
tatakau hero

100
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:24,620
A fighting hero

101
00:04:24,620 --> 00:04:31,170
kodoku na hero

102
00:04:24,620 --> 00:04:31,170
A lone hero

103
00:04:26,790 --> 00:04:27,460
I

104
00:04:27,460 --> 00:04:28,120
I

105
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:28,750
I

106
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:29,710
I

107
00:04:29,710 --> 00:04:30,380
I

108
00:04:30,380 --> 00:04:30,920
I

109
00:04:31,170 --> 00:04:36,170
i wanna be a saikyou hero

110
00:04:31,170 --> 00:04:36,170
I wanna be the strongest hero

111
00:04:38,590 --> 00:04:41,090
THE FOLLOWING DAY

112
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:45,600
It's quiet today too!

113
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:48,350
There's nothing to do!

114
00:04:48,350 --> 00:04:50,810
I'm gonna lose my registration!

115
00:04:55,070 --> 00:04:57,870
Hey! You're that guy...

116
00:04:57,870 --> 00:04:59,320
What was it?

117
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:02,010
"Seed-on-the-Ground..."?

118
00:05:02,010 --> 00:05:04,820
No wait, "Lost-and-found..."?

119
00:05:04,820 --> 00:05:06,530
Jack-o'-lantern Panic!

120
00:05:06,530 --> 00:05:08,040
It's Speed-o'-Sound Sonic.

121
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:11,290
I've finally found you, Saitama.

122
00:05:11,290 --> 00:05:13,630
Today is the day we—

123
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:16,040
Hey sorry, I'm busy. See you 'round..

124
00:05:16,780 --> 00:05:18,000
Huh?

125
00:05:18,530 --> 00:05:20,560
You think...

126
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:23,300
...you can run from me?!

127
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:28,970
What the—?
I didn't see what happened.

128
00:05:29,370 --> 00:05:33,230
His face should have been
sliced open, but the blade...

129
00:05:33,230 --> 00:05:36,650
I told you...I'm busy.

130
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:40,490
Plus I'm pissed,
so anyone in my way...

131
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:44,110
...gets punched.

132
00:05:45,770 --> 00:05:47,450
That's him!

133
00:05:47,450 --> 00:05:48,830
He's very, very dangerous.

134
00:05:48,830 --> 00:05:50,410
Please stop him.

135
00:05:50,410 --> 00:05:54,320
So you're the offender, eh?!

136
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:57,840
Well, the hero Tank-Top Tiger
is here now!

137
00:05:58,320 --> 00:06:00,090
Hero?

138
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:04,090
Sonic, they think you're
some sort of criminal.

139
00:06:04,090 --> 00:06:07,140
Maybe getting tossed in a cell
will cool off your hot—

140
00:06:07,910 --> 00:06:10,560
She means you, cue ball.

141
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,680
Huh?

142
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,770
He's been running around town

143
00:06:13,770 --> 00:06:17,230
with this scary look on his face
since yesterday!

144
00:06:17,230 --> 00:06:18,940
But I'm a hero too!

145
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:21,980
I've never heard of a hero like you.

146
00:06:21,980 --> 00:06:23,820
So what? I just started!

147
00:06:23,820 --> 00:06:27,390
In any case, you're causing
problems for everyone.

148
00:06:27,390 --> 00:06:31,120
If you're really a hero, then don't
go around frightening people.

149
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:33,960
You're hurting
all the other heroes' reputation.

150
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:36,500
Hey isn't that Tank-Top Tiger?

151
00:06:36,500 --> 00:06:38,540
Oh yeah, it is Tank-Top Tiger.

152
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:39,670
No way!

153
00:06:39,670 --> 00:06:41,380
Awesome, he's the real deal!

154
00:06:44,740 --> 00:06:49,550
Even Class C heroes get recognized
if they're in the top 10.

155
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:52,680
So how 'bout it, new guy?

156
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:56,520
Wanna go a little wild here
and make me look good?

157
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:58,480
Exploding Shuriken.

158
00:07:00,150 --> 00:07:02,030
EXPLODING
SHURIKEN

159
00:07:05,350 --> 00:07:06,900
Tank-Top Tiger?!

160
00:07:06,900 --> 00:07:08,390
Is this really happening?

161
00:07:08,390 --> 00:07:11,120
What are you doing, Sonic?

162
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:14,770
He was interfering,
so I put him to sleep.

163
00:07:14,770 --> 00:07:16,710
Hey, call a hero!

164
00:07:16,710 --> 00:07:17,500
A hero!

165
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:18,910
Run!

166
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:21,170
Saitama...

167
00:07:21,170 --> 00:07:25,710
So you too have become one of
these worthless "heroes?"

168
00:07:26,530 --> 00:07:29,050
Then all I have to do
is create a situation

169
00:07:29,050 --> 00:07:33,600
where you have no choice
but to fight me, Saitama the Hero!

170
00:07:34,870 --> 00:07:36,930
Hail of Carnage!

171
00:07:42,110 --> 00:07:43,110
Huh?

172
00:07:46,590 --> 00:07:48,350
Hey! Cut it out!

173
00:07:48,350 --> 00:07:51,240
Saitama, come stop me!

174
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,830
You're a hero!

175
00:07:52,830 --> 00:07:54,580
I'll kill them all!

176
00:08:00,430 --> 00:08:02,360
Damn it.

177
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:05,200
Can't everyone
just let me do my job?

178
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:08,050
I don't have time for this!

179
00:08:08,660 --> 00:08:11,590
I gotta find a bad guy to take down.

180
00:08:15,210 --> 00:08:16,850
A bad guy?

181
00:08:17,670 --> 00:08:20,260
If you're not coming, I'll go to you!

182
00:08:20,260 --> 00:08:21,690
I'm right here.

183
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:34,200
I wonder if this will count as work?

184
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:38,910
The man apprehended in City Z
by the Class C hero

185
00:08:38,910 --> 00:08:42,000
is suspected of being involved in
several heinous crimes,

186
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,750
including assassination.

187
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:46,630
City Z...

188
00:08:48,870 --> 00:08:51,550
What's the status of
the investigation I requested?

189
00:08:51,550 --> 00:08:53,720
The one for the ghost town?

190
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:54,260
Yes.

191
00:08:54,260 --> 00:08:55,930
Let's see...

192
00:08:56,810 --> 00:08:59,310
We've submitted an official request.

193
00:09:00,500 --> 00:09:03,850
Well now,
doesn't that sound interesting.

194
00:09:03,850 --> 00:09:05,800
Want me to go?

195
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:07,230
Tornado?

196
00:09:07,230 --> 00:09:08,530
Where'd you come from?

197
00:09:08,530 --> 00:09:10,610
Why? Aren't I allowed in here?

198
00:09:10,610 --> 00:09:11,610
Of course.

199
00:09:11,610 --> 00:09:15,070
But for City Z,
the investigation is just a formality.

200
00:09:15,070 --> 00:09:16,530
What?

201
00:09:16,530 --> 00:09:19,540
You think I'm not good enough?

202
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,580
Not at all.

203
00:09:23,580 --> 00:09:27,880
The Association decided that
this was not a Class S matter.

204
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:30,090
Yes, exactly right.

205
00:09:34,370 --> 00:09:38,510
You'd better tell me if you find
anything that looks like it can fight.

206
00:09:41,330 --> 00:09:44,180
It'd be so much faster
if I just went myself.

207
00:09:44,710 --> 00:09:46,520
You're such an idiot.

208
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:17,640
CITY A -
HERO ASSOCIATION HQ

209
00:10:15,890 --> 00:10:18,970
Reports have come in from each location being investigated.

210
00:10:21,370 --> 00:10:24,520
First is Watchdog Man,
Class S hero, investigating City Q.

211
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,600
"Nothing unusual."

212
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:26,980
Nothing unusual?

213
00:10:26,980 --> 00:10:29,090
- That's right.
- That's hard to believe.

214
00:10:29,090 --> 00:10:31,820
We all know City Q is a hot zone

215
00:10:31,820 --> 00:10:35,570
with more casualties and monsters
than any other area.

216
00:10:35,570 --> 00:10:38,660
Knowing him,
I'm sure he's implying that,

217
00:10:38,660 --> 00:10:42,450
"Whatever occurs,
I'll be able to take care of it."

218
00:10:42,450 --> 00:10:45,750
Though he has focused
his efforts on City Q,

219
00:10:45,750 --> 00:10:49,340
his track record at
monster elimination is top-notch.

220
00:10:49,340 --> 00:10:51,710
Class S heroes don't
pay much attention to details.

221
00:10:51,710 --> 00:10:54,050
They're not cut out
for writing reports.

222
00:10:54,050 --> 00:10:56,470
Next, City W.

223
00:10:56,470 --> 00:10:59,510
Class A hero Heavy Kong reports:
"Nothing unusual."

224
00:10:59,870 --> 00:11:03,560
For City H, reports from Mushroom,
Class B, and Horsebone, Class C:

225
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,600
"Nothing unusual."

226
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:07,310
For City D, Lightning Genji,
Class A:

227
00:11:07,310 --> 00:11:10,480
"Slow restoration after
the devastation caused by"

228
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:12,880
"the gigantic creature aside,
nothing unusual."

229
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:16,450
Cities B and D
both sustained extensive damage.

230
00:11:16,450 --> 00:11:18,890
The Association took
a lot of heat for that.

231
00:11:18,890 --> 00:11:21,530
In order to prevent
more such disasters,

232
00:11:21,530 --> 00:11:25,870
we must detect any covert activity
that could threaten the community.

233
00:11:25,870 --> 00:11:30,170
Well, this investigation was
requested for that express purpose.

234
00:11:30,170 --> 00:11:33,690
But early detection of monsters
is proving difficult.

235
00:11:33,690 --> 00:11:37,130
City F, Class A hero,
"Snakebite" Snek.

236
00:11:37,130 --> 00:11:40,770
"Hammerhead, former leader
of the Paradiser terrorist group,"

237
00:11:40,770 --> 00:11:43,560
"has been spotted
in a suit and tie."

238
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:45,270
"Further investigation
is being conducted."

239
00:11:45,270 --> 00:11:46,600
No other reports.

240
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:48,270
What of City Z?

241
00:11:48,270 --> 00:11:51,900
I hear rumblings of
a potential disaster brewing

242
00:11:51,900 --> 00:11:53,690
in the abandoned area there.

243
00:11:53,690 --> 00:11:55,520
No reports available.

244
00:11:56,010 --> 00:11:59,450
However, two highly capable
Class A heroes

245
00:11:59,450 --> 00:12:02,990
have been sent to the area
to investigate.

246
00:12:04,690 --> 00:12:06,790
Here we are in City Z.

247
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:11,290
CLASS A, RANK 33 -
SPRING MUSTACHIO

248
00:12:08,310 --> 00:12:11,290
Shall we begin our little inquiry?

249
00:12:11,500 --> 00:12:15,170
CLASS A, RANK 29 -
GOLDEN BALL

250
00:12:11,650 --> 00:12:15,210
Yeah, let's get on with it.

251
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:23,680
City Z is quite expansive,
but further ahead lies

252
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:27,030
the uninhabited area
we were told about.

253
00:12:27,030 --> 00:12:28,430
Compared with other areas,

254
00:12:28,180 --> 00:12:32,440
BEWARE OF MONSTERS!!

255
00:12:28,430 --> 00:12:33,230
City Z has an abnormally high rate
of monster-related incidents.

256
00:12:33,230 --> 00:12:36,860
The frequency has been gradually
increasing over the past 10 years,

257
00:12:36,860 --> 00:12:39,110
while the last few have seen
more and more

258
00:12:39,110 --> 00:12:40,640
highly advanced monsters appearing.

259
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:44,200
The residents have entirely fled
for the city center.

260
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,540
I know all that.

261
00:12:45,540 --> 00:12:47,660
The place is a real ghost town,

262
00:12:47,660 --> 00:12:50,620
just with the water and electricity
still intact, yeah?

263
00:12:50,620 --> 00:12:52,920
On the lookout for a cheap house?

264
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:54,320
Come off it.

265
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:57,550
People say something
real nasty's living 'round here.

266
00:12:57,550 --> 00:12:59,410
Even you must've heard.

267
00:12:59,410 --> 00:13:00,720
But of course.

268
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:05,220
I assume that's why we have been
assigned this investigation.

269
00:13:05,220 --> 00:13:10,080
Once we hit the abandoned area,
we better be ready to fight.

270
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:13,940
Indeed,
we mustn't let our guard down.

271
00:13:15,170 --> 00:13:18,990
But, why here?
Why the increase in monsters here?

272
00:13:19,090 --> 00:13:20,970
That's the mystery.

273
00:13:20,970 --> 00:13:24,870
Many theories have been advanced,
but my own is this:

274
00:13:24,870 --> 00:13:28,580
A colony of monsters here is
naturally producing more of them.

275
00:13:28,580 --> 00:13:31,910
Or perhaps a queen exists,
birthing more of her kind.

276
00:13:34,690 --> 00:13:38,280
Of course I have no proof yet,

277
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:41,240
but there is something
to this ghost town...

278
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:44,180
Or rather, something in it.

279
00:13:44,180 --> 00:13:46,470
Of that you can be sure.

280
00:13:47,870 --> 00:13:50,250
The proximity alarm?

281
00:13:50,250 --> 00:13:52,360
If we can hunt down
this mysterious being,

282
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:54,900
we'll go straight to
the top of the rankings.

283
00:13:54,900 --> 00:13:56,270
That's true.

284
00:13:56,270 --> 00:13:59,220
We can't let Mr. Amai Mask
remain first for—

285
00:13:59,220 --> 00:14:00,570
- Something's there?!
- Something's there?!

286
00:14:00,570 --> 00:14:01,990
Was that a monster?

287
00:14:01,990 --> 00:14:03,760
No way to be sure...

288
00:14:03,760 --> 00:14:08,120
But it's hard to imagine a human
still living in these conditions.

289
00:14:08,120 --> 00:14:09,780
Let's pursue it!

290
00:14:12,810 --> 00:14:15,290
Seems they are not after us.

291
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:19,960
Can this be the place
I heard about?

292
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:22,990
Sure don't seem like it...

293
00:14:22,990 --> 00:14:27,970
Aw man, I came all this way.
Isn't anyone around?

294
00:14:30,250 --> 00:14:33,060
A monster.
It popped up out of nowhere.

295
00:14:33,430 --> 00:14:36,110
Golden Ball, are you ready?

296
00:14:36,110 --> 00:14:37,230
Hell yes.

297
00:14:37,230 --> 00:14:39,150
Victory to the swift!

298
00:14:39,150 --> 00:14:40,480
Hey, people!

299
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:43,280
I can blast through
a 20mm steel plate

300
00:14:43,280 --> 00:14:45,530
with one of my shape-memory
golden bullets!

301
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:47,860
Eat this!

302
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:57,960
He flicked it away like nothing.

303
00:15:10,330 --> 00:15:11,970
Golden Ball!

304
00:15:42,030 --> 00:15:43,550
Wow!

305
00:15:53,580 --> 00:15:55,720
Tomboy...

306
00:15:56,740 --> 00:15:58,180
...thrust!

307
00:16:01,340 --> 00:16:04,400
It slipped past my Tomboy?

308
00:16:10,180 --> 00:16:11,780
Not bad.

309
00:16:12,250 --> 00:16:13,780
Those tentacles...

310
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:16,370
From the way they react,
they're tough as steel.

311
00:16:16,370 --> 00:16:19,580
A monster that can use
its infinite number of tentacles

312
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:21,210
like steel whips...

313
00:16:21,860 --> 00:16:23,670
Such power!

314
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:30,510
I must call in reinforcements
from the Association.

315
00:16:30,830 --> 00:16:35,890
May I ask if you were born
in this neighborhood?

316
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:39,270
Nah, I'm from out of town.

317
00:16:39,270 --> 00:16:44,110
I heard a bunch of crazy strong monsters
were all getting together here.

318
00:16:44,110 --> 00:16:48,380
Looks like it was
just a rumor though.

319
00:16:48,380 --> 00:16:50,030
But now,

320
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:57,140
I feel like it'd be kinda fun to
stick around and make the rumor true.

321
00:16:57,140 --> 00:16:59,380
"The Ghost Town Monster..."

322
00:16:59,380 --> 00:17:02,250
It's got a nice ring to it!

323
00:17:02,860 --> 00:17:06,880
We have a backup request from
the heroes dispatched to City Z.

324
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:10,300
Class A rank 29, Golden Ball,
has been knocked out.

325
00:17:10,300 --> 00:17:13,510
Class A rank 33,
Spring Mustachio, is in trouble.

326
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:14,900
They're in the abandoned city.

327
00:17:14,900 --> 00:17:17,670
Call in all nearby heroes
for immediate assistance!

328
00:17:17,670 --> 00:17:19,140
Class A and above!

329
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:22,230
See the monster alert for City Z?

330
00:17:22,230 --> 00:17:24,660
The threat level seems to be
Tiger or higher.

331
00:17:24,660 --> 00:17:26,980
Is it the ghost town monster?

332
00:17:26,980 --> 00:17:28,960
They're not sure yet.

333
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:30,610
I'll go...

334
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:34,030
I want to catch the tiger
by its tail.

335
00:17:46,070 --> 00:17:47,710
Now I see...

336
00:17:47,710 --> 00:17:51,220
If it means running into monsters
like this all the time

337
00:17:51,220 --> 00:17:54,720
I wouldn't want to
live here either.

338
00:17:58,210 --> 00:18:01,480
Man, boring. This is boring me!

339
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:05,480
I finally kick a hero's butt
and I don't get even a single scream.

340
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:09,450
Now that I think about it,
even if I start living here,

341
00:18:09,450 --> 00:18:12,190
I'll never be famous
if there's no people.

342
00:18:12,510 --> 00:18:17,280
Guess I'll keep going.
Gotta find where they live.

343
00:18:18,520 --> 00:18:20,410
There's somebody.

344
00:18:20,410 --> 00:18:22,660
Another hero?

345
00:18:23,020 --> 00:18:24,990
Or a regular guy?

346
00:18:24,990 --> 00:18:27,670
I thought all the humans
cleared out.

347
00:18:27,670 --> 00:18:29,920
If all those monsters
were really around,

348
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:32,210
there's no way he could live here...

349
00:18:33,870 --> 00:18:37,750
I guess that means
it was just a rumor.

350
00:18:37,750 --> 00:18:39,260
Shoot...

351
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:42,770
I forgot to buy konbu soup stock.

352
00:18:46,550 --> 00:18:50,270
Master, I saw a lot of konbu
right outside the door.

353
00:18:50,270 --> 00:18:52,770
Oh yeah, I just...

354
00:18:54,140 --> 00:18:58,320
just happened...
to get it for cheap.

355
00:19:01,310 --> 00:19:03,950
Yes, people say that konbu
is good for hair growth,

356
00:19:03,950 --> 00:19:06,340
but since there is
no real scientific proof,

357
00:19:06,340 --> 00:19:08,710
its real effects
are yet to be confirmed.

358
00:19:08,710 --> 00:19:11,960
I did some research,
so I am sure, Master.

359
00:19:12,710 --> 00:19:14,460
For example,
according to this site—

360
00:19:14,460 --> 00:19:16,220
No one said anything about hair!

361
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:18,720
City Z Investigative Report.

362
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:22,720
"Nothing noteworthy about
the downtown or residential areas."

363
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:24,310
"During our investigation,"

364
00:19:24,310 --> 00:19:27,690
"we encountered a ferocious monster
in the abandoned area,"

365
00:19:27,690 --> 00:19:29,230
"but were unable to
exterminate it."

366
00:19:29,230 --> 00:19:31,310
"We escaped death,"

367
00:19:31,310 --> 00:19:33,480
"but the monster
we encountered disappeared"

368
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:36,110
"and it is possible that
it still roams the area."

369
00:19:36,110 --> 00:19:39,700
"Also, according to this monster,
there's a rumor that..."

370
00:19:39,700 --> 00:19:43,490
"...powerful monsters
already exist in this area."

371
00:19:43,490 --> 00:19:47,500
Sounds like it was pretty brutal.

372
00:19:47,500 --> 00:19:49,170
A monster?

373
00:19:49,170 --> 00:19:50,500
Yes.

374
00:19:51,740 --> 00:19:55,010
I think I'll pass this time.

375
00:19:55,010 --> 00:19:58,300
See? I told you I should have gone!

376
00:19:58,300 --> 00:19:59,510
But...

377
00:19:59,510 --> 00:20:01,450
faced with this,

378
00:20:01,450 --> 00:20:05,600
I'm sure even you would
have had a tough time.

379
00:20:09,520 --> 00:20:13,400
I would have been fine, idiot!

380
00:20:14,050 --> 00:20:17,860
The rumor has not been confirmed,
but the reinforcements saw signs

381
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:21,310
that point to the existence
of some horrible monstrosity.

382
00:20:21,310 --> 00:20:23,980
Holy crap, what is this?

383
00:20:23,980 --> 00:20:26,690
What kind of monster could
cause such violence?

384
00:20:26,690 --> 00:20:29,790
I'd hate to face off
against this thing.

385
00:20:30,770 --> 00:20:32,290
Hey, what's this?

386
00:20:32,820 --> 00:20:36,210
Is it a part of the monster
Spring Mustachio fought?

387
00:20:36,210 --> 00:20:38,340
There may have been
a territorial dispute

388
00:20:38,340 --> 00:20:39,760
between the monsters...

389
00:20:40,080 --> 00:20:43,760
Seems like there's definitely
"something" here.

390
00:20:44,600 --> 00:20:50,020
We must continue our investigation
and maintain vigilance over City Z.

391
00:20:51,130 --> 00:20:52,730
Hey, did you hear?

392
00:20:52,730 --> 00:20:55,520
There are monsters living
in the City Z ghost town.

393
00:20:55,520 --> 00:21:00,400
Yeah, rumor has it the toughest ones
are secretly plotting something.

394
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:05,030
No, no. Not that rumor.
It's about a more dangerous monster.

395
00:21:05,030 --> 00:21:06,240
What's that?

396
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:07,160
You didn't hear?

397
00:21:07,160 --> 00:21:09,580
I hear the place
has now become terrifying

398
00:21:09,580 --> 00:21:12,710
for both humans and monsters.

399
00:21:13,130 --> 00:21:17,630
THE TERRIFYING CITY

