1073
00:22:52,470 --> 00:22:54,060
Oh, thanks!

1074
00:22:54,060 --> 00:22:54,690
Also,

1075
00:22:54,690 --> 00:23:00,190
MYSTERY MONSTER DEFEATS: CLASS A HEROES

1076
00:22:54,690 --> 00:23:00,190
your rank has gone up
from last place, 388th, to 342nd.

1077
00:23:00,190 --> 00:23:03,360
Oh? Because of that Panic guy?

1078
00:23:03,360 --> 00:23:04,980
He boosted my ranking.

1079
00:23:06,560 --> 00:23:08,530
So it's been a week now.

1080
00:23:08,530 --> 00:23:10,100
Have you done anything?

1081
00:23:10,100 --> 00:23:12,420
No, not yet.

1082
00:23:12,420 --> 00:23:14,210
I guess it's only been a week.

1083
00:23:14,210 --> 00:23:18,080
I'm still ranked last in Class S
for ability... in 17th place.

1084
00:23:18,080 --> 00:23:21,880
Sounds like you've still got
a lot of training to do, Genos.

1085
00:23:23,320 --> 00:23:27,220
But in the public polls,
for popularity I rank number six.

1086
00:23:27,970 --> 00:23:29,600
Why?!

1087
00:23:29,600 --> 00:23:32,680
"A genius who, at the tender age
of 19, made his debut in Class S."

1088
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,930
"He'll do great."

1089
00:23:33,930 --> 00:23:35,230
"He's so handsome."

1090
00:23:35,230 --> 00:23:37,980
"Love how he refuses to do
media interviews. Very cool."

1091
00:23:37,980 --> 00:23:39,940
Those kinds of comments.

1092
00:23:39,940 --> 00:23:42,980
You're not embarrassed
to read those out loud?

1093
00:23:42,980 --> 00:23:46,530
These comments are based on
impressions from my photo,

1094
00:23:46,530 --> 00:23:48,700
not evaluations of me.

1095
00:23:48,700 --> 00:23:49,620
I think nothing of them.

1096
00:23:50,080 --> 00:23:51,410
Oh yeah?

1097
00:23:51,410 --> 00:23:52,660
They continue.

1098
00:23:52,660 --> 00:23:53,870
"The Cyborg Prince."

1099
00:23:53,870 --> 00:23:56,380
"Behind the steely exterior,
I feel his fragile self."

1100
00:23:56,380 --> 00:23:57,910
"Among the top five
handsomest heroes."

1101
00:23:57,910 --> 00:23:59,630
Enough already!

1102
00:23:59,630 --> 00:24:19,600
NEXT EPISODE:

1103
00:23:59,630 --> 00:24:19,600
THE SURPREME DISCIPLE

1104
00:24:00,080 --> 00:24:01,780
This is Blizzard.

1105
00:24:01,780 --> 00:24:04,780
Perhaps you
know me better as
"Blizzard from Hell?"

1106
00:24:05,320 --> 00:24:08,120
Well, I only had a bit
part this episode.

1107
00:24:08,120 --> 00:24:10,580
Next on
One-Punch Man
is episode 7,

1108
00:24:10,580 --> 00:24:12,260
The Ultimate
Disciple

1109
00:24:13,260 --> 00:24:15,600
The Blizzard Bunch
will finally make
its appearance.

1110
00:24:15,600 --> 00:24:18,520
Miss Blizzard, we're
NOT scheduled
to go on next week!

1111
00:24:18,520 --> 00:24:19,560
That can't be right!
